cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PrivAI: Privacy-First Local Multi-Agent AI Assistant"
abstract: >
  PrivAI is a fully local, privacy-preserving AI assistant built with a modular multi-agent
  architecture. It runs entirely on-device using Ollama (Phi-3 Mini, TinyLlama), ChromaDB,
  and SentenceTransformers. Features include multi-agent chat routing, document summarization,
  natural language task management, and RAG-powered document Q&A. No cloud APIs, no data
  leakage, with optional AES-256 encryption and differential privacy support.
